{"type":"Film","id":"ES2017_064","slug":"es2017-064-una-funcion-para-olvidar","title":{"native":"Una función para olvidar","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-11-09","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Martín Garrido Ramis","slug":"martin-garrido-ramis","name":"Martín Garrido Ramis","birthYear":1952,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5515214/mediaviewer/rm2938198528/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5515214/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_0_tt_8_nm_0_in_0_q_Una%2520funci%25C3%25B3n%2520para%2520olvidar"},"synopsis":{"native":"Una excéntrica y madura actriz, dueña de una compañía de teatro, que cada año es subvencionada, instala a todos los actores en un pequeño hotel junto a la playa para tenerlos concentrados. Y ensaya en el aula del instituto de la zona. En los primeros ensayos parece que todo va bien hasta que el ambiente y la convivencia se va calentando y aparecen las miserias del ser humano, como la envidia, el egoísmo, la superficialidad, la maldad... Será un intenso mes, y cuando parece que se va romper la compañía, surge la magia del teatro: el espectáculo debe de continuar.","english":"An actress, owner of a theater company, installs all the actors in a small hotel to have them concentrated. The atmosphere in the rehearsals is getting warmer and the miseries of the human being between the actors come to light."},"production":[{"country":"Spain","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"ES2017_064_01","film":"ES2017_064","person":{"id":"Fernando Esteso","slug":"fernando-esteso","name":"Fernando Esteso","birthYear":1945,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Unknown","ability":"Able-bodi